{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vFXuy2E2rL1794568858.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地衛星互聯網企業國星宇航首日掛牌，股價「潛水」。</p><p></p><p>收報24.02元，較招股價24.9元低百分之3.5。以每手100股，不計手續費，一手帳面蝕88元。</p><p></p><p>股份公開發售部分，錄得2.4倍超額認購，一手中籤率百分之60，國際發售超購約0.79倍，集資淨額約6.5億元，用於提升研發能力等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.347978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:39:47.681937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:34.996785+00:00","content_hash":"8b2eda69d4bb99de511e9612b83c1a6ac86dc5c877335d5d80f2acbc8bc76218","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.347978+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}